error[SC0411]: `*u` may be read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_pointer_read_out_of_memory_that_names_an_unwritten_local_array_is_doubted.c:7:10 ]
   │
 7 │     int *r = *u;
   │          ───┬──  
